# Runtime data and credentials are local-only.
server/runtime/config.json
server/runtime/connection-info.txt
# 这两份文件都是先写同目录 `.<name>.<pid>.tmp` 再 replace 的原子写入产物，
# 中间态与正式文件内容完全相同：一份是 accessToken 明文，一份是带 ?token= 的面板地址。
# 进程被 SIGKILL 或掉电时中间态会留在 runtime/ 里；只忽略正式文件名，
# 等于「Token 不进 Git」这道铁律的第一道防线对着中间态大开。
server/runtime/.config.json.*.tmp
server/runtime/.connection-info.txt.*.tmp
server/runtime/time/*
!server/runtime/time/.gitkeep
server/runtime/finance/*
!server/runtime/finance/.gitkeep
server/logs/
# `server/web` is the committed, reviewable dashboard release artifact.  Runtime
# state stays excluded above; do not hide a stale dashboard build from Git.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.DS_Store
node_modules/
dist/
# 设计审查钩子的本地缓存，非项目内容；发布物扫描会因它拒绝打包。
.impeccable/
